WEBVTT


00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.980
=Wonder Wall=

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:37.910
=Episode 16=

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.159
I need to pee.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:56.359
Watch them.

00:01:58.359 --> 00:02:00.519
I need to go too.

00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:03.280
I can't hold it.

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:04.799
Hurry up.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:06.560
Don't get smart with me.

00:02:06.599 --> 00:02:08.120
Or you will regret it.

00:02:08.319 --> 00:02:09.280
I'm old.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:10.520
Not like you.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.800
You are young and quick.

00:02:11.879 --> 00:02:13.840
I'm old. I can't get far.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.439
Hurry up.

00:02:18.479 --> 00:02:19.960
I will take her too.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.159
Wenwen, run!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.120
Run!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:40.639
What are you doing?

00:02:40.639 --> 00:02:41.319
Run, Wenwen!

00:02:41.319 --> 00:02:41.719
What are you doing?

00:02:41.719 --> 00:02:42.280
Zhan Chun!

00:02:42.479 --> 00:02:43.039
Stop!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.960
She's running! Get her!

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.120
Don't look back! Run, Wenwen!

00:03:00.439 --> 00:03:01.360
Run!

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.840
Come on!

00:03:11.439 --> 00:03:12.039
You bit me?

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:13.520
You little brat.

00:03:14.479 --> 00:03:15.560
Dad!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.240
Yu Ming!

00:03:19.039 --> 00:03:19.560
Get in!

00:03:20.439 --> 00:03:21.080
Don't fight me.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.159
Wenwen, don't be scared.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:28.759
It is okay, Wenwen.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:29.759
You are okay.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.400
I want to go home.

00:03:39.599 --> 00:03:40.879
He's back.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.120
- Where did he go?
- Calm down.

00:03:42.599 --> 00:03:43.240
Relax.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.000
So you do know the way back.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:44.520
Mom.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.280
You remember I'm your mother?

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:46.759
Mom.

00:03:47.439 --> 00:03:48.400
Where were you?

00:03:48.439 --> 00:03:49.400
Every time Wenwen is with you,

00:03:49.439 --> 00:03:50.719
something goes wrong.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.560
If anything

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:52.479
happens to Wenwen,

00:03:52.719 --> 00:03:54.319
I will never let you off.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.159
Get Wenwen back. Now!

00:03:56.159 --> 00:03:57.360
All right. All right.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:58.879
Don't get worked up.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.280
Hello?

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:02.599
Fan Meijuan.

00:04:02.879 --> 00:04:03.520
Yu Wenwen.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.919
15 million each.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.080
30 million for both.

00:04:06.319 --> 00:04:07.680
Get the money ready. Wait for my call.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.439
Who are you?

00:04:08.639 --> 00:04:09.199
Where are you?

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:09.919
Talk to me!

00:04:10.759 --> 00:04:12.199
Where is my granddaughter?

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.319
Give her back right now!

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.719
Or I'm calling the police!

00:04:14.919 --> 00:04:15.479
Police?

00:04:15.719 --> 00:04:16.360
Try it.

00:04:16.439 --> 00:04:17.040
Call the police,

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.560
and I'll cut their throats.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:20.399
You...

00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:22.720
He hung up.

00:04:23.319 --> 00:04:23.879
Call him back.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:29.639
Look at me.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.000
Old lady.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.000
Come on.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.160
No. Not this one.

00:04:35.439 --> 00:04:36.959
Look at me. Just look at me!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.480
Don't you understand my words?

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:40.600
Look at me.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:44.680
You. Look at me.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.439
Why are you all so stubborn?

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.800
Come on.

00:04:54.399 --> 00:04:54.959
Ma'am.

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:57.000
Don't call me that.

00:05:02.319 --> 00:05:03.319
That money

00:05:04.399 --> 00:05:05.360
is not yours either.

00:05:06.279 --> 00:05:07.639
Part of it is our wages.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.120
Once we get paid,

00:05:09.439 --> 00:05:10.360
we will let you go.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:11.800
Keep fighting us,

00:05:12.439 --> 00:05:13.600
and things get ugly.

00:05:14.319 --> 00:05:15.240
So work with us.

00:05:25.839 --> 00:05:26.720
Okay. This works.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.160
Look here.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.120
How is it?

00:05:40.199 --> 00:05:40.759
The photos...

00:05:42.199 --> 00:05:42.680
Mom.

00:05:42.879 --> 00:05:43.279
Give it to me.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:43.879
Mom. Mom.

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:45.439
I said give it to me!

00:05:45.439 --> 00:05:46.199
Did you hear me?

00:05:54.279 --> 00:05:54.680
Call...

00:05:54.839 --> 00:05:55.240
Call...

00:05:55.399 --> 00:05:55.720
Call...

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:56.199
Call him...

00:05:56.199 --> 00:05:56.720
I will. I will.

00:05:57.079 --> 00:05:57.560
I'm calling.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:58.600
Call him...

00:05:58.680 --> 00:05:59.240
I am.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.360
I am. Mom.

00:06:01.079 --> 00:06:01.560
I'm calling.

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:03.879
Lanying!

00:06:03.879 --> 00:06:04.199
Mom!

00:06:04.639 --> 00:06:04.920
Lanying!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:05.360
Mom!

00:06:05.727 --> 00:06:09.500
(Outpatient)

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.639
How could you let her

00:06:10.879 --> 00:06:12.319
see these photos?

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:13.800
She just grabbed it from me.

00:06:14.199 --> 00:06:15.240
She's always like this.

00:06:15.879 --> 00:06:17.360
Hotheaded and impulsive.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.800
What about Yitong?

00:06:19.879 --> 00:06:20.560
What will you tell her?

00:06:21.439 --> 00:06:22.319
I have not figured it out.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.439
She panics easily too.

00:06:32.079 --> 00:06:32.839
Family of Sun Lanying?

00:06:32.839 --> 00:06:33.240
Yes.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.759
I got you an extra slot.

00:06:35.079 --> 00:06:36.560
Go upstairs to Neurology.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.000
You go. I'll stay with her.

00:06:52.079 --> 00:06:53.000
Pay the bill first.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:55.079
These are the results

00:06:55.079 --> 00:06:55.560
from the CT scan.

00:06:55.759 --> 00:06:58.319
Her cerebral arteries hardened.

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.079
The vessels are narrowed.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.759
When she gets emotional,

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.240
her blood pressure keeps fluctuating.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.120
That reduces blood flow to the brain.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:07.720
These two conditions

00:07:07.759 --> 00:07:08.720
affect each other.

00:07:08.879 --> 00:07:09.360
As her family,

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.600
you need to be very careful.

00:07:11.959 --> 00:07:12.800
If it gets serious,

00:07:12.839 --> 00:07:14.079
what could happen?

00:07:14.279 --> 00:07:15.480
It could cause cardiac arrest.

00:07:16.279 --> 00:07:17.079
You must keep her

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.639
from getting emotionally worked up.

00:07:18.959 --> 00:07:19.680
Avoid upsetting her.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.600
She has been very agitated.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:22.759
Why is she

00:07:22.959 --> 00:07:24.160
so agitated?

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:26.560
She does not seem to have

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:27.800
any psychiatric issues.

00:07:28.399 --> 00:07:29.839
Something happened.

00:07:31.199 --> 00:07:32.240
Her grandchild is missing.

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:33.360
What?

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.521
(Wen Yitong)

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.040
Hello, Yitong.

00:07:56.319 --> 00:07:57.480
I can't reach Yu Ming.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:58.480
Is he with you?

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.160
Let's take the stairs.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:27.720
Sorry. Sorry.

00:08:27.759 --> 00:08:28.639
I'm sorry.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:29.519
What is wrong with you?

00:08:29.519 --> 00:08:30.839
Why are you so careless?

00:08:33.559 --> 00:08:34.120
Ming.

00:08:34.519 --> 00:08:35.120
Are you okay?

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:35.639
I'm fine.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.200
Don't rush too much.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.039
Mom is this sick.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.919
Wenwen and her grandma are missing.

00:08:44.279 --> 00:08:46.240
Whatever monsters they are,

00:08:46.919 --> 00:08:48.360
however cruel they may be,

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.559
I will bring them back.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:56.799
I'm sorry. Sorry.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:57.879
Yitong called me.

00:08:58.159 --> 00:08:58.960
She kept asking.

00:08:59.159 --> 00:09:00.279
I couldn't keep it from her.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:01.440
I'm sorry.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.200
It's Yitong.

00:09:06.799 --> 00:09:07.279
Answer it.

00:09:08.399 --> 00:09:09.320
The longer you hide it,

00:09:09.399 --> 00:09:10.320
the worse it gets.

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:16.519
Hi.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:18.679
So you were not going to tell me?

00:09:19.879 --> 00:09:20.879
When were you planning to let me know?

00:09:20.919 --> 00:09:22.039
After they killed them?

00:09:22.559 --> 00:09:23.399
Were they kidnapped?

00:09:23.399 --> 00:09:24.000
Were they?

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:24.799
Yes.

00:09:25.759 --> 00:09:27.360
I didn't know how to tell you.

00:09:27.759 --> 00:09:28.960
And now, Mom has collapsed.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:30.799
How much do they want?

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:31.759
30 million.

00:09:32.279 --> 00:09:32.720
Give them.

00:09:33.159 --> 00:09:34.240
Whatever they ask, do it.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.879
Yitong said she is going to Unit 505.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.360
Take care of my mom.

00:10:13.159 --> 00:10:14.279
Take a break. Let me do it.

00:10:14.639 --> 00:10:15.279
I got it. I got it.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:19.679
Easy. Easy.

00:10:20.679 --> 00:10:22.080
Before, they sat on the money

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.639
and refused to admit a thing.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:26.600
Now, they can't wait to give it back.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.639
Blood has been spilled.

00:10:30.159 --> 00:10:31.080
They are scared.

00:10:32.759 --> 00:10:33.440
Money.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.240
It always makes fools of people.

00:10:36.919 --> 00:10:37.960
Text him.

00:10:43.052 --> 00:10:45.496
(Hopefully, next time we meet,
we both get what we want.)

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:46.919
What does he mean, "meet"?

00:10:48.559 --> 00:10:49.080
Think about it.

00:10:49.519 --> 00:10:50.759
Who knows about the 30 million?

00:10:50.799 --> 00:10:51.480
Besides Hong Jinkui

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:52.159
and us.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:52.679
Who else?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:53.159
Li Jin.

00:10:53.159 --> 00:10:53.759
Zinuo's mother.

00:10:53.879 --> 00:10:54.639
It has to be her.

00:10:54.639 --> 00:10:55.960
She knows about the 30 million,

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.399
and she is capable of kidnapping.

00:10:57.519 --> 00:10:57.919
Right?

00:10:58.039 --> 00:10:58.919
Hong Jinkui is dead.

00:10:58.919 --> 00:11:00.120
If not her, then who?

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:02.320
Let me call her.

00:11:08.559 --> 00:11:08.960
Hello?

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.720
Where did you take them?

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.399
Didn't we tell you

00:11:12.399 --> 00:11:13.679
we would return everything?

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:14.720
Didn't we tell you

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.919
we would cooperate?

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:16.879
What is this stunt

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:17.639
supposed to mean?

00:11:17.679 --> 00:11:18.559
You spent five years inside.

00:11:18.559 --> 00:11:19.440
Was that not enough?

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.519
Have you lost your mind?

00:11:20.559 --> 00:11:21.360
I'm telling you,

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.759
if anything happens to them,

00:11:22.759 --> 00:11:24.039
you will rot in prison!

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:24.759
And Chen Zinuo

00:11:24.759 --> 00:11:26.320
will never hold her head up again!

00:11:26.399 --> 00:11:27.480
You are being reckless.

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:30.639
Don't provoke her!

00:11:30.919 --> 00:11:32.240
What good does yelling do?

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.279
I wanted to scare her.

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:34.960
Does she think I'm a pushover?

00:11:35.039 --> 00:11:36.120
What does this call

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:36.919
solve right now?

00:11:36.919 --> 00:11:37.639
Tell me.

00:11:42.519 --> 00:11:43.480
I told you,

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.399
don't provoke her!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.559
His family has been kidnapped.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:50.440
Looks like

00:11:51.879 --> 00:11:53.519
someone else is after the money.

00:11:54.159 --> 00:11:55.000
Weird.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.480
Everyone who knew about it,

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.080
I already dealt with them.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.240
Clearly, not clean enough.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:06.240
Answer it.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:08.320
Hello?

00:12:08.639 --> 00:12:09.960
The ones being kidnapped...

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:10.879
Sir, 60 million for two people.

00:12:10.879 --> 00:12:11.360
We will give you.

00:12:11.399 --> 00:12:12.039
All of them.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.279
We will give you everything we have.

00:12:13.279 --> 00:12:13.759
Okay?

00:12:16.039 --> 00:12:17.639
We don't have 60 million now.

00:12:17.639 --> 00:12:18.399
The two million

00:12:18.399 --> 00:12:20.000
went to San and the others.

00:12:20.039 --> 00:12:20.360
Sir.

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:21.799
We have 58 million now.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:22.840
That is everything

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:23.639
we have left.

00:12:23.679 --> 00:12:24.120
We...

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.440
We will give it all to you.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.919
58 million is still a lot.

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:27.679
With that money,

00:12:27.679 --> 00:12:29.080
you can live very well, okay?

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.080
Yes, 58 million is a lot.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:31.720
Please, it's an elder and a child.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:32.759
Don't hurt them. Please don't.

00:12:32.759 --> 00:12:33.240
This house...

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.120
The house is worth five million.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:34.799
Sir, five million.

00:12:34.799 --> 00:12:35.080
Please.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.240
You can have the house too.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:36.679
Okay?

00:12:36.679 --> 00:12:37.279
All of it.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.120
Everything. Please.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:38.559
Okay?

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:43.879
Fine.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.799
Get the 58 million ready.

00:12:45.799 --> 00:12:46.440
Wait for my call.

00:12:51.919 --> 00:12:53.039
58 million.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.480
Who would say no to more money?

00:13:01.519 --> 00:13:02.440
We need to move fast.

00:13:02.759 --> 00:13:03.320
She is crazy.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.080
I will go to talk to Zinuo.

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:04.799
Okay.

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.360
For now, the treatment

00:13:12.399 --> 00:13:13.600
will focus on thrombolysis

00:13:13.879 --> 00:13:15.200
to improve cerebral blood flow.

00:13:15.879 --> 00:13:17.279
But you should be prepared.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.159
She may develop

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.000
paralysis or slurred speech.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:22.919
As for her prognosis,

00:13:23.399 --> 00:13:24.399
it's too early to say.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.759
Have you found the child?

00:13:28.399 --> 00:13:28.960
Not yet.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.600
You need to find the kid quickly.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.240
After she wakes up,

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:33.600
the worst thing for her

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.480
is another major emotional shock.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:36.840
That could make

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:37.919
her condition much worse.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:41.159
Thank you.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:05.960
Sir.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:06.840
Yes?

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.320
I need ten of these cases.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:10.840
Do you have them?

00:14:11.279 --> 00:14:12.240
How many? Ten?

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:12.799
Ten.

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:13.799
Yes, no problem.

00:14:13.879 --> 00:14:14.720
I will pack them now.

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:15.679
Have a seat.

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:21.360
Eat something first.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.440
♪Hoarded wealth♪

00:14:24.799 --> 00:14:27.039
You haven't eaten
since yesterday afternoon.

00:14:27.639 --> 00:14:28.559
They are still missing,

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:29.799
so we can't break down.

00:14:29.799 --> 00:14:32.000
♪Behind smiling faces♪

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.080
♪Holding on to grudges♪

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.120
Why Sichuan food?

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.760
♪Becomes your prison♪

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.039
♪Desire feeds illusions♪

00:14:39.039 --> 00:14:39.919
You like it.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.320
♪Leaving nothing behind♪

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.600
Not as good as my mom's cooking.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:46.640
♪Greed and cunning♪

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.159
I shouldn't have let her come.

00:14:48.159 --> 00:14:49.560
♪Only bring ruin upon oneself♪

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.200
♪Without trust♪

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.280
♪One sails alone through life♪

00:14:55.321 --> 00:14:57.560
♪A kind heart lights the path♪

00:14:57.649 --> 00:15:00.720
♪Through the darkest night♪

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.320
♪After hardship♪

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:05.320
♪The fog clears and the sun rises♪

00:15:06.128 --> 00:15:08.200
♪The dream of fame and fortune ends♪

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:11.080
♪True hearts are revealed
in times of trial♪

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:17.640
♪A good and honest life
is all that truly matters♪

00:15:19.759 --> 00:15:20.279
Dad.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:21.960
Is Mom awake?

00:15:23.039 --> 00:15:23.919
Your mom is fine.

00:15:24.279 --> 00:15:25.360
I'm here with her.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.480
You two need to stay safe.

00:15:28.559 --> 00:15:29.919
Did the kidnappers call?

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.240
So you are taking them the money?

00:15:35.039 --> 00:15:35.759
Once they get it,

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.080
they will let them go.

00:15:38.559 --> 00:15:39.440
Ming.

00:15:40.559 --> 00:15:41.840
You are a good man.

00:15:43.799 --> 00:15:44.679
But you know,

00:15:46.159 --> 00:15:47.360
to us,

00:15:47.799 --> 00:15:49.159
you matter most.

00:15:49.759 --> 00:15:50.879
Don't get into

00:15:51.799 --> 00:15:53.399
any conflict with the kidnappers.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:57.360
There is no shame in backing down.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.360
Your safety comes first.

00:16:01.679 --> 00:16:03.519
The whole family depends on you.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:05.879
For your family,

00:16:06.639 --> 00:16:07.879
bowing your head

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.120
doesn't make you weak.

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:14.320
Remember to eat on time.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:18.559
Good boy.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:38.840
Zinuo.

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:40.399
Ouyang.

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:41.519
Listen to me first.

00:16:41.759 --> 00:16:42.679
Your mom kidnapped

00:16:42.799 --> 00:16:43.519
Yu Wenwen

00:16:43.759 --> 00:16:44.600
and Wen Yitong's mother for money.

00:16:44.879 --> 00:16:45.639
Yu Ming has the money ready.

00:16:45.639 --> 00:16:46.480
He can give it to her anytime.

00:16:46.679 --> 00:16:47.639
Tell her not to do anything rash.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:53.480
Where are you going?

00:16:53.559 --> 00:16:54.679
The show is about to start.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:55.360
Everyone.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.559
I called you all here today

00:16:56.559 --> 00:16:57.360
because this is serious.

00:16:57.919 --> 00:16:58.720
My benefactor,

00:16:58.759 --> 00:17:00.039
Mr. Yu, who saved my life,

00:17:00.159 --> 00:17:01.480
needs our help urgently.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.120
Yesterday, just yesterday,

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:04.599
his daughter and mother-in-law

00:17:04.599 --> 00:17:05.200
went missing.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:06.240
They still haven't been found.

00:17:06.279 --> 00:17:07.400
Qian Weijie, what are you doing?

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:08.599
Did you forget

00:17:08.599 --> 00:17:09.880
how they played us before?

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:11.960
That is Zihan's school money.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.480
Whatever happened, she is my niece.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:14.359
How can I ignore this?

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.200
Hello, Mr. Hou.

00:17:16.279 --> 00:17:17.400
I sent you the photos

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:18.079
of the two missing people.

00:17:18.279 --> 00:17:18.839
Please contact

00:17:18.839 --> 00:17:19.839
the travel agency drivers

00:17:19.839 --> 00:17:20.480
and ask them to keep an eye out.

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:21.680
If there is any news,

00:17:21.839 --> 00:17:22.799
please tell me right away.

00:17:24.039 --> 00:17:25.240
Did everyone get the message?

00:17:25.519 --> 00:17:26.279
Yes.

00:17:26.279 --> 00:17:27.359
Split up and search.

00:17:27.559 --> 00:17:28.599
Every second counts.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:29.440
Go!

00:17:29.599 --> 00:17:30.119
Go!

00:17:30.359 --> 00:17:31.599
Their information and photos

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:32.440
have been sent

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.160
to the car club group.

00:17:33.359 --> 00:17:33.920
Now,

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.039
let's not waste time.

00:17:35.079 --> 00:17:36.000
Everyone, move!

00:17:36.119 --> 00:17:36.559
Okay?

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:37.400
- Okay!
- Go!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:51.960
Open the door!

00:17:53.519 --> 00:17:54.039
Li Jin.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.079
Open up!

00:17:58.319 --> 00:17:58.920
Li Jin.

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.028
(Chen Zinuo)

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:23.680
Hello?

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.279
I know what you are doing.

00:18:25.799 --> 00:18:26.599
She is with you now,

00:18:26.599 --> 00:18:27.200
isn't she?

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:31.960
Don't say anything.

00:18:32.319 --> 00:18:32.880
Just listen.

00:18:34.079 --> 00:18:34.559
Okay.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:36.319
Let them go now.

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.319
I promise Yu Ming will let it go.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.799
But if anything happens to them,

00:18:40.039 --> 00:18:40.559
none of us

00:18:40.559 --> 00:18:41.359
will get out of this clean.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:44.400
Stay out of things

00:18:44.839 --> 00:18:45.640
that are not yours.

00:18:46.359 --> 00:18:47.680
I'm not meddling, Lei.

00:18:47.799 --> 00:18:48.799
Do you know

00:18:48.799 --> 00:18:49.519
the consequences?

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:50.640
Fine.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:51.839
Say you get the money.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:52.880
Then what?

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.240
You know Li Jin.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.240
Chen Liyang is the warning.

00:18:59.359 --> 00:18:59.920
Don't worry.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:01.119
It's all covered.

00:19:04.359 --> 00:19:05.400
Where are they now?

00:19:09.599 --> 00:19:10.400
Don't ask that.

00:19:16.279 --> 00:19:17.920
The van for the money is ready.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:20.720
Just as you said,

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:21.839
an older model.

00:19:22.599 --> 00:19:23.680
The plate has been changed too.

00:19:24.079 --> 00:19:25.200
An Ancheng plate.

00:19:26.279 --> 00:19:26.839
Good.

00:19:27.319 --> 00:19:28.079
Please think of something.

00:19:28.079 --> 00:19:28.519
Please.

00:19:28.519 --> 00:19:29.200
Wenwen is stubborn.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.119
She always has been.

00:19:30.119 --> 00:19:31.279
I'm afraid she'll anger them.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:31.880
And

00:19:32.039 --> 00:19:33.200
Ms. Fan isn't well.

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.599
She can't take this kind of stress.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:37.680
I can't promise that.

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:40.799
But I know Li Jin.

00:19:42.319 --> 00:19:43.480
As long as she gets what she wants,

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:45.359
she won't make trouble.

00:19:45.519 --> 00:19:46.240
I understand.

00:19:46.319 --> 00:19:46.960
The money is ready.

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.039
They will have it.

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:48.880
So you have to

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:50.000
talk your mom down.

00:19:50.319 --> 00:19:51.720
Wenwen is his brother's child.

00:19:51.759 --> 00:19:52.759
She is his whole life.

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:56.279
Please. I'm begging you.

00:20:12.005 --> 00:20:13.703
(Chun'an County, Luzhou City)

00:20:16.359 --> 00:20:17.960
There is a van at this location.

00:20:18.279 --> 00:20:19.720
Put the money in it.

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:52.880
Is this it?

00:21:03.079 --> 00:21:04.759
♪Work hard and make money♪

00:21:04.839 --> 00:21:05.720
(Unknown Number)
♪I want to get rich♪

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:06.260
(Unknown Number)

00:21:07.119 --> 00:21:07.640
Hello?

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.000
Once the money is loaded,

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.759
call this number.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:13.880
He can see us.

00:21:21.559 --> 00:21:22.000
Don't provoke him.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:22.880
I will go get the money.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.039
We need backup too.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:27.960
Ouyang?

00:21:28.599 --> 00:21:29.359
Jiajia?

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:30.960
We are taking the money
to the kidnappers.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.200
Wait for me in Unit 505.

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:11.920
How is it?

00:22:12.119 --> 00:22:12.880
What's happening now?

00:22:12.960 --> 00:22:13.839
Has the money gone out?

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:15.000
I don't know. I just got here.

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:32.039
One, two, three.

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:34.480
Okay.

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:35.200
Your phone.

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:38.079
♪A villa by the sea♪

00:22:38.079 --> 00:22:39.079
♪Seafood every day♪

00:22:40.839 --> 00:22:41.960
The money is loaded.

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:43.599
I will send you another address.

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:47.720
I will follow you in your car.

00:22:47.799 --> 00:22:48.640
I can help if anything happens.

00:22:49.279 --> 00:22:50.039
Here are the keys.

00:22:51.893 --> 00:22:53.300
(Sandao Valley)

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:54.440
He sent the location.

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:55.000
Let's go.

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:00.759
Great-grandma.

00:23:02.279 --> 00:23:03.039
This trip,

00:23:03.759 --> 00:23:04.680
just like you said,

00:23:05.640 --> 00:23:06.640
we met a kind benefactor.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:08.000
We got our money back.

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:10.599
We even bought a van.

00:23:11.519 --> 00:23:12.720
I won't leave for work anymore.

00:23:14.480 --> 00:23:15.160
I will drive a taxi

00:23:16.279 --> 00:23:16.960
and spend more time with you.

00:23:19.039 --> 00:23:20.359
Mr. Yu is a good man.

00:23:20.839 --> 00:23:21.640
If not for him,

00:23:22.039 --> 00:23:23.119
we would never have got our money.

00:23:33.519 --> 00:23:33.960
Great-grandma.

00:23:34.279 --> 00:23:34.759
What's wrong?

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:35.480
What is it?

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:36.640
Don't scare me.

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:37.240
What...

00:23:38.279 --> 00:23:40.079
Why, whenever I mention Mr. Yu,

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:40.920
do you start knocking?

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:42.319
Did something

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:43.160
happen to him?

00:23:44.079 --> 00:23:44.599
Great-grandma.

00:23:46.039 --> 00:23:46.920
Say something.

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:50.119
What...

00:23:50.559 --> 00:23:51.680
She fell asleep now?

00:24:31.319 --> 00:24:32.799
A good horse sees no ditch.

00:24:33.480 --> 00:24:35.000
A coward sees only hurdles.

00:24:35.279 --> 00:24:36.599
Once we get Wenwen and your mom back,

00:24:36.759 --> 00:24:38.160
we start a new life.

00:24:38.519 --> 00:24:39.279
That is our victory.

00:24:45.079 --> 00:24:45.720
Gauze.

00:24:45.720 --> 00:24:47.000
Alcohol, iodine.

00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:47.599
Cold medicine.

00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:49.319
Medicine for bruises and sprains.

00:24:49.559 --> 00:24:50.680
Are we missing anything?

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:51.640
I packed some food too.

00:24:51.640 --> 00:24:52.279
Who knows how long

00:24:52.279 --> 00:24:53.039
they have gone without eating.

00:25:08.839 --> 00:25:09.880
This is it, right?

00:25:15.240 --> 00:25:16.000
(Leave the van.)

00:25:16.359 --> 00:25:17.440
(I sent you where they are.)

00:25:17.720 --> 00:25:18.519
(Go find them yourselves.)

00:25:21.559 --> 00:25:22.240
Go. Go.

00:26:19.599 --> 00:26:20.160
- Hey.
- San.

00:26:20.839 --> 00:26:21.519
What happened?

00:26:22.119 --> 00:26:23.000
Why call me over this late?

00:26:23.039 --> 00:26:24.000
I was half asleep.

00:26:24.440 --> 00:26:25.279
Great-grandma said

00:26:25.480 --> 00:26:26.680
something happened to Mr. Yu.

00:26:28.079 --> 00:26:29.160
She can talk now?

00:26:29.359 --> 00:26:29.799
No.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:30.960
When I was

00:26:30.960 --> 00:26:31.880
washing her feet,

00:26:32.119 --> 00:26:32.960
I mentioned Mr. Yu,

00:26:33.119 --> 00:26:34.400
and she started tapping her cane.

00:26:34.519 --> 00:26:35.319
She kept tapping.

00:26:35.480 --> 00:26:36.279
Scared me to death.

00:26:36.440 --> 00:26:37.799
Last time she tapped like that

00:26:37.799 --> 00:26:38.640
was four or five years ago.

00:26:38.680 --> 00:26:40.480
Two people passed by.

00:26:40.480 --> 00:26:41.960
She kept tapping and tapping.

00:26:42.039 --> 00:26:42.680
A few days later,

00:26:42.799 --> 00:26:43.519
there was heavy rain.

00:26:43.559 --> 00:26:44.559
A mudslide hit their village,

00:26:44.559 --> 00:26:45.559
and those two died.

00:26:46.880 --> 00:26:47.480
Right.

00:26:47.759 --> 00:26:48.279
Exactly.

00:26:48.480 --> 00:26:49.160
Then...

00:26:49.440 --> 00:26:50.440
Did you ask her

00:26:50.440 --> 00:26:51.880
what happened to Mr. Yu?

00:26:52.119 --> 00:26:53.160
I was just about to,

00:26:53.559 --> 00:26:54.400
then she fell asleep.

00:26:54.559 --> 00:26:55.119
Let's go.

00:26:55.119 --> 00:26:55.759
Let's ask her.

00:26:55.759 --> 00:26:56.759
Ask her.

00:26:56.759 --> 00:26:57.880
- Go.
- Wait.

00:26:57.880 --> 00:26:58.440
Let's ask her.

00:26:58.480 --> 00:26:59.480
Ask your great-grandma.

00:26:59.559 --> 00:27:00.519
No, no.

00:27:01.759 --> 00:27:02.759
When my great-grandma falls asleep,

00:27:02.920 --> 00:27:04.039
her spirit leaves her body.

00:27:04.039 --> 00:27:05.079
If we wake her, it may not come back.

00:27:05.279 --> 00:27:05.960
Then...

00:27:06.039 --> 00:27:07.599
What do we do?

00:27:07.640 --> 00:27:08.079
What,

00:27:08.200 --> 00:27:09.880
wait for her spirit to return?

00:27:10.039 --> 00:27:10.480
Ma'am.

00:27:10.559 --> 00:27:11.480
Are you asleep?

00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:15.119
She is awake.

00:27:15.400 --> 00:27:16.480
She was not asleep.

00:27:16.519 --> 00:27:17.359
Then go. Ask her.

00:27:17.359 --> 00:27:17.839
Go.

00:27:17.920 --> 00:27:18.720
Listen.

00:27:21.039 --> 00:27:21.599
How many taps?

00:27:21.920 --> 00:27:22.400
Two.

00:27:22.599 --> 00:27:23.519
She meant no.

00:27:28.240 --> 00:27:28.680
Well...

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:30.400
Wait.

00:27:30.960 --> 00:27:31.960
Ask her

00:27:32.240 --> 00:27:33.599
what happened to Mr. Yu.

00:27:33.880 --> 00:27:34.599
Yes, yes.

00:27:37.400 --> 00:27:38.119
Great-grandma.

00:27:39.359 --> 00:27:40.880
What happened to Mr. Yu?

00:27:41.799 --> 00:27:43.000
That is too vague.

00:27:43.000 --> 00:27:44.160
It could be anything.

00:27:44.200 --> 00:27:44.759
Right.

00:27:45.079 --> 00:27:45.480
Like,

00:27:45.559 --> 00:27:47.200
murder, arson, kidnapping...

00:27:47.200 --> 00:27:47.839
Which one?

00:27:51.720 --> 00:27:52.400
Oh my God.

00:27:52.759 --> 00:27:53.440
Kidnapping?

00:27:56.559 --> 00:27:57.759
Ask her.

00:27:57.759 --> 00:27:58.599
Who got kidnapped?

00:27:59.599 --> 00:28:00.119
Great-grandma.

00:28:00.480 --> 00:28:01.960
Was Mr. Yu kidnapped?

00:28:03.559 --> 00:28:04.079
No?

00:28:04.680 --> 00:28:05.160
No.

00:28:05.240 --> 00:28:05.960
No. Good.

00:28:06.160 --> 00:28:06.759
Good heavens.

00:28:07.000 --> 00:28:07.960
All that drama.

00:28:08.640 --> 00:28:09.599
That's good.

00:28:10.279 --> 00:28:11.400
Then who got kidnapped?

00:28:14.640 --> 00:28:15.599
Could it be

00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:18.000
someone in Mr. Yu's family?

00:28:28.200 --> 00:28:28.920
Wenwen!

00:28:29.079 --> 00:28:29.839
Mom!

00:28:30.440 --> 00:28:31.039
Wenwen!

00:28:31.119 --> 00:28:31.839
Mom!

00:28:32.359 --> 00:28:33.119
Wenwen!

00:28:33.200 --> 00:28:34.640
Fan Meijuan!

00:28:36.640 --> 00:28:37.759
- Fan Meijuan!
- Wenwen!

00:28:38.200 --> 00:28:39.279
Wenwen!

00:28:39.799 --> 00:28:40.519
Mom!

00:28:41.000 --> 00:28:41.720
Wenwen!

00:28:42.640 --> 00:28:43.279
Wenwen!

00:28:43.440 --> 00:28:44.200
Wenwen!

00:28:44.880 --> 00:28:46.319
- Mom!
- Split up!

00:28:46.440 --> 00:28:47.279
You go that way.

00:28:47.440 --> 00:28:48.240
We will go this way.

00:28:48.359 --> 00:28:48.960
Wenwen!

00:28:50.480 --> 00:28:51.680
Fan Meijuan!

00:28:51.839 --> 00:28:52.359
Wenwen!

00:28:52.400 --> 00:28:53.160
Wenwen!

00:28:53.640 --> 00:28:54.440
Mom!

00:28:55.599 --> 00:28:57.160
(Unknown Number)
I still can't reach Jiang Juan.

00:28:58.519 --> 00:28:59.200
Sorry.

00:28:59.680 --> 00:29:00.839
The number you dialed

00:29:00.839 --> 00:29:02.200
is unavailable.

00:29:02.599 --> 00:29:03.759
Call again!

00:29:06.200 --> 00:29:07.039
Sorry.

00:29:07.400 --> 00:29:08.599
The number you dialed

00:29:08.599 --> 00:29:09.839
is unavailable.

00:29:10.480 --> 00:29:11.119
Wenwen!

00:29:11.359 --> 00:29:12.160
Wenwen!

00:29:12.200 --> 00:29:13.079
Wenwen!

00:29:14.720 --> 00:29:16.440
(Unknown Number)
♪Work hard and make money♪

00:29:16.440 --> 00:29:16.910
(Unknown Number)

00:29:17.440 --> 00:29:17.920
Hello?

00:29:18.319 --> 00:29:19.039
Where is my 30 million?

00:29:19.319 --> 00:29:20.039
Is it ready?

00:29:20.359 --> 00:29:20.839
What?

00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:21.759
Wasn't it fi...

00:29:24.480 --> 00:29:25.480
There are two different groups.

00:29:25.480 --> 00:29:26.480
This one never got the money.

00:29:26.559 --> 00:29:28.480
They are not the same people.

00:29:29.279 --> 00:29:30.440
Yu Ming, we paid the wrong people.

00:29:30.880 --> 00:29:31.599
There are two groups.

00:29:32.480 --> 00:29:33.559
Yu Ming, two groups.

00:29:33.680 --> 00:29:34.279
How could this...?

00:29:34.799 --> 00:29:35.279
Hello.

00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:36.200
Could you

00:29:36.319 --> 00:29:37.960
let Fan Meijuan speak?

00:29:38.039 --> 00:29:39.799
And please let the child talk too.

00:29:40.039 --> 00:29:40.759
Dad!

00:29:41.440 --> 00:29:42.559
Don't hit her!

00:29:42.920 --> 00:29:44.160
Please don't hit her!

00:29:45.559 --> 00:29:47.519
We can talk this through.

00:29:47.920 --> 00:29:49.319
Why are you doing this?

00:29:49.400 --> 00:29:50.880
Why are you hurting them?

00:29:56.160 --> 00:29:57.599
Yu Ming!

00:29:59.039 --> 00:29:59.839
Dad!

00:30:01.759 --> 00:30:02.839
Dad!

00:30:04.079 --> 00:30:04.920
Don't hit them!

00:30:04.960 --> 00:30:06.519
Please! Listen to me!

00:30:06.559 --> 00:30:08.480
I'm begging you!

00:30:08.680 --> 00:30:10.839
Dad! Yu Ming!

00:30:10.920 --> 00:30:12.200
They didn't get a cent.

00:30:12.240 --> 00:30:13.240
Not a cent.

00:30:13.240 --> 00:30:13.880
What do you mean?

00:30:13.960 --> 00:30:14.680
Wrong people.

00:30:15.039 --> 00:30:15.920
Dad!

00:30:16.759 --> 00:30:17.160
Hey.

00:30:17.519 --> 00:30:19.160
Who was that? Who just spoke?

00:30:19.359 --> 00:30:20.200
You called the police, did you?

00:30:20.319 --> 00:30:20.920
No!

00:30:21.000 --> 00:30:21.880
I didn't call the police!

00:30:22.079 --> 00:30:24.039
Just a friend. No police!

00:30:24.160 --> 00:30:25.480
I can't trust you. You are lying.

00:30:25.480 --> 00:30:26.359
You are playing me, are you?

00:30:26.400 --> 00:30:27.000
Listen.

00:30:27.039 --> 00:30:28.279
Your mom has ten fingers.

00:30:28.440 --> 00:30:29.240
You upset me once,

00:30:29.240 --> 00:30:29.920
and I cut one off.

00:30:29.920 --> 00:30:31.079
Twice, I cut two.

00:30:31.119 --> 00:30:32.519
Three times, I cut four.

00:30:32.559 --> 00:30:33.440
The old first, then the kid.

00:30:33.440 --> 00:30:34.000
Believe me or not?

00:30:34.000 --> 00:30:34.720
If I don't see the money tomorrow,

00:30:34.720 --> 00:30:35.480
you can collect their bodies.

00:30:36.000 --> 00:30:36.400
Listen!

00:30:36.920 --> 00:30:37.839
- Listen to me!
- We will pay!

00:30:37.960 --> 00:30:39.799
We will!

00:30:40.039 --> 00:30:41.559
Please!

00:30:44.119 --> 00:30:45.039
They don't want to pay.

00:30:45.200 --> 00:30:45.920
They are just messing with us.

00:30:46.839 --> 00:30:48.079
Time to show them some blood.

00:31:03.279 --> 00:31:04.119
Here. Over here.

00:31:05.640 --> 00:31:06.960
Put some more up here.

00:31:08.079 --> 00:31:09.000
There. Over there.

00:31:09.079 --> 00:31:09.880
Yes, right there.

00:31:12.240 --> 00:31:13.079
Use more.

00:31:13.720 --> 00:31:14.960
Yes. More of it.

00:31:15.799 --> 00:31:16.839
Here, let me.

00:31:17.799 --> 00:31:19.359
This is how you do it.

00:31:19.640 --> 00:31:21.000
There. That should do it.

00:31:21.440 --> 00:31:22.200
Much better.

00:31:22.240 --> 00:31:23.079
Now take the picture.

00:31:34.559 --> 00:31:35.720
It must be Mr. Yu's money

00:31:35.720 --> 00:31:36.599
that drew them in.

00:31:37.119 --> 00:31:38.119
Ask your great-grandma.

00:31:38.400 --> 00:31:39.599
Where is Mr. Yu's family?

00:31:39.920 --> 00:31:40.359
Great-grandma.

00:31:40.640 --> 00:31:42.480
Where is Mr. Yu's family?

00:31:45.440 --> 00:31:46.119
Great-grandma.

00:31:46.960 --> 00:31:47.559
Ma'am.

00:31:48.920 --> 00:31:49.559
Ma'am.

00:31:54.000 --> 00:31:54.599
It's ok.

00:31:57.799 --> 00:31:58.359
Great-grandma.

00:31:59.680 --> 00:32:01.480
Maybe ask the spirit for a sign.

00:32:10.359 --> 00:32:11.000
Water signs.

00:32:11.519 --> 00:32:12.799
The sign points to water.

00:32:13.880 --> 00:32:14.640
They are near water.

00:32:18.599 --> 00:32:19.839
Isn't she hard of hearing?

00:32:19.960 --> 00:32:20.839
She heard that whisper?

00:32:20.839 --> 00:32:21.799
Enough. Stop talking.

00:32:22.160 --> 00:32:23.400
There are lots of places with water.

00:32:23.559 --> 00:32:24.359
Rivers.

00:32:24.440 --> 00:32:24.960
Wells.

00:32:24.960 --> 00:32:25.680
Ponds.

00:32:25.759 --> 00:32:26.519
What kind of water?

00:32:30.799 --> 00:32:31.599
None of those?

00:32:33.640 --> 00:32:34.799
Then what water is it?

00:32:35.920 --> 00:32:36.480
The sea!

00:32:38.000 --> 00:32:39.119
The sea!

00:32:39.160 --> 00:32:40.240
Call Mr. Yu now.

00:32:40.240 --> 00:32:40.799
The seaside.

00:32:41.039 --> 00:32:42.240
Stop. Enough.

00:32:42.599 --> 00:32:44.319
Luzhou is surrounded by the sea.

00:32:44.880 --> 00:32:45.559
Which side?

00:32:46.480 --> 00:32:47.319
Well...

00:32:48.680 --> 00:32:49.480
It points north.

00:32:50.920 --> 00:32:51.519
North.

00:32:57.559 --> 00:32:58.119
There.

00:32:59.039 --> 00:32:59.759
The northern shore.

00:33:01.720 --> 00:33:02.200
Hello?

00:33:02.319 --> 00:33:03.599
Mr. Yu, it's me,

00:33:03.599 --> 00:33:04.279
Tiezhu.

00:33:04.279 --> 00:33:04.839
What do you want?

00:33:05.119 --> 00:33:05.960
Well...

00:33:05.960 --> 00:33:07.640
Was someone in your family kidnapped?

00:33:08.240 --> 00:33:08.599
How...

00:33:08.839 --> 00:33:09.559
How did you know?

00:33:09.720 --> 00:33:11.400
My great-grandma sees everything.

00:33:11.599 --> 00:33:13.319
Mr. Yu, who was taken?

00:33:13.480 --> 00:33:14.119
My daughter.

00:33:14.400 --> 00:33:15.240
And my mother-in-law.

00:33:15.440 --> 00:33:16.119
Where are they?

00:33:16.319 --> 00:33:18.119
In the north!

00:33:18.319 --> 00:33:20.799
- By the sea!
- They are by the sea!

00:33:20.960 --> 00:33:22.119
What? What?

00:33:22.759 --> 00:33:24.759
San said his great-grandma saw

00:33:24.759 --> 00:33:25.920
my daughter and mother-in-law

00:33:25.920 --> 00:33:27.000
on the northern shore.

00:33:27.039 --> 00:33:27.839
She divined it!

00:33:28.079 --> 00:33:28.480
Go!

00:33:28.519 --> 00:33:28.960
Calm down.

00:33:28.960 --> 00:33:29.720
Everyone, calm down.

00:33:29.880 --> 00:33:30.480
Don't rush.

00:33:30.680 --> 00:33:32.160
Let's check it first.

00:33:32.599 --> 00:33:34.119
Stay steady. Don't panic.

00:33:34.240 --> 00:33:35.359
We split into two teams.

00:33:35.400 --> 00:33:36.119
You go to the shore.

00:33:36.240 --> 00:33:37.200
I will stay with Yitong.

00:33:37.240 --> 00:33:38.119
The kidnapper will definitely

00:33:38.119 --> 00:33:38.880
contact us again.

00:33:38.920 --> 00:33:39.880
Whoever he calls,

00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:41.000
we have to keep him talking.

00:33:41.440 --> 00:33:42.119
You come with me.

00:33:42.119 --> 00:33:42.519
Okay.

00:33:42.759 --> 00:33:43.559
Be careful.

00:33:45.920 --> 00:33:46.400
Tiezhu.

00:33:47.359 --> 00:33:48.240
What do we do now?

00:33:53.240 --> 00:33:53.680
Go.

00:33:54.440 --> 00:33:55.039
To Luzhou.

00:33:55.279 --> 00:33:55.799
Let's save them.

00:33:56.119 --> 00:33:56.799
Now?

00:33:57.880 --> 00:33:59.000
What are we waiting for?

00:33:59.200 --> 00:34:00.200
We can't just stand by

00:34:00.200 --> 00:34:01.240
and do nothing.

00:34:29.559 --> 00:34:30.519
See that?

00:34:30.679 --> 00:34:32.320
He bought a cheap piece of junk.

00:34:35.239 --> 00:34:36.159
It's bad, Jiajia.

00:34:36.400 --> 00:34:37.199
Money went to the wrong ones.

00:34:40.039 --> 00:34:41.360
We made a mistake.

00:34:44.280 --> 00:34:45.440
It may sound crazy.

00:34:46.280 --> 00:34:47.400
But it's still our hope.

00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:48.599
Even if it's a small chance.

00:34:51.651 --> 00:34:52.838
(Unknown Number)

00:34:54.400 --> 00:34:55.000
It's him.

00:34:55.599 --> 00:34:56.280
This is the guy.

00:34:56.679 --> 00:34:57.400
Okay. I'll record it.

00:34:57.400 --> 00:34:57.840
Okay.

00:35:02.880 --> 00:35:03.360
Hello?

00:35:03.679 --> 00:35:05.280
Yu Ming is not picking up.

00:35:05.599 --> 00:35:06.000
Listen.

00:35:06.000 --> 00:35:07.039
Don't play games with me.

00:35:07.159 --> 00:35:08.199
I know what you are trying to do.

00:35:08.480 --> 00:35:09.480
Sir, please listen to me.

00:35:09.519 --> 00:35:10.360
The people you have

00:35:10.360 --> 00:35:11.800
mean everything to us.

00:35:12.239 --> 00:35:13.239
Whatever you want,

00:35:13.239 --> 00:35:14.159
we will give it to you.

00:35:14.159 --> 00:35:15.119
Not just the money.

00:35:15.320 --> 00:35:16.400
You can have our villa too.

00:35:16.400 --> 00:35:17.679
Everything we own,

00:35:17.719 --> 00:35:18.360
you can have it.

00:35:18.360 --> 00:35:19.239
I can give you everything.

00:35:19.239 --> 00:35:20.440
All of it.

00:35:20.760 --> 00:35:21.599
I'm begging you.

00:35:21.679 --> 00:35:23.280
They mean nothing to you.

00:35:23.320 --> 00:35:24.239
I promise you,

00:35:24.440 --> 00:35:26.000
we really are trying

00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:26.639
to get you the money.

00:35:26.880 --> 00:35:27.320
Good.

00:35:28.039 --> 00:35:29.480
Money first. Then you get them back.

00:35:30.480 --> 00:35:31.679
Sir. Sir!

00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:42.320
Yitong.

00:35:43.000 --> 00:35:43.599
Call the police.

00:35:44.440 --> 00:35:46.199
He's going to kill them.

00:35:47.920 --> 00:35:49.760
There is still time.

00:35:50.320 --> 00:35:51.039
Searching like this is like

00:35:51.360 --> 00:35:52.239
looking for a needle
in a haystack.

00:35:53.159 --> 00:35:54.000
It's too hard.

00:35:54.599 --> 00:35:55.639
We have to trust the police.

00:35:58.280 --> 00:35:59.840
It's not too late.

00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:21.480
Nuo hates the money's smell.

00:36:22.400 --> 00:36:23.079
She said it's dirty.

00:36:26.320 --> 00:36:27.480
It's not the money that's dirty.

00:36:28.639 --> 00:36:29.599
It's the people.

00:36:32.760 --> 00:36:33.480
Did you count it?

00:36:34.119 --> 00:36:34.960
Not yet.

00:36:37.920 --> 00:36:38.960
Count every bill.

00:37:23.960 --> 00:37:25.559
58 million. It's all there.

00:37:28.760 --> 00:37:30.320
I found an underground bank.

00:37:32.960 --> 00:37:34.639
Run the money through twice,

00:37:35.159 --> 00:37:36.039
and it comes out clean.

00:37:38.079 --> 00:37:39.360
Only when the money is clean

00:37:40.039 --> 00:37:41.400
can Nuo take it.

00:37:43.719 --> 00:37:45.559
She still doesn't understand.

00:37:47.079 --> 00:37:48.239
Everything I have done,

00:37:49.039 --> 00:37:50.719
in the end, was for her.

00:37:52.000 --> 00:37:53.559
I just want her to have a good life.

00:37:57.000 --> 00:37:58.280
When I was pregnant,

00:37:58.719 --> 00:37:59.920
I imagined it so many times

00:38:01.519 --> 00:38:02.480
about what my child

00:38:02.480 --> 00:38:03.719
would become one day.

00:38:05.360 --> 00:38:07.119
I thought of every possibility.

00:38:08.320 --> 00:38:09.880
Just not this.

00:38:12.159 --> 00:38:13.320
I'm disappointed.

00:38:15.760 --> 00:38:17.199
Still, I must catch her if she falls.

00:38:25.239 --> 00:38:25.679
Hello?

00:38:28.400 --> 00:38:28.880
Good.

00:38:29.920 --> 00:38:31.480
I will have the money sent over.

00:38:35.280 --> 00:38:36.320
I sent you the address.

00:38:38.119 --> 00:38:38.840
Be careful on the way.

00:38:40.039 --> 00:38:40.519
I will.

00:39:27.599 --> 00:39:28.440
Wenwen.

00:39:30.639 --> 00:39:33.000
I don't think I'm going home.

00:39:35.800 --> 00:39:36.679
I may never

00:39:37.760 --> 00:39:40.239
cook for you again.

00:39:41.320 --> 00:39:42.519
When you are on your own,

00:39:42.679 --> 00:39:45.840
remember to have less fried chicken.

00:39:46.119 --> 00:39:47.280
That's not true, Grandma.

00:39:48.559 --> 00:39:49.239
Dad and Mom

00:39:49.239 --> 00:39:50.480
will be here soon.

00:39:51.599 --> 00:39:52.480
When you get better,

00:39:52.639 --> 00:39:54.199
I still want your spicy chicken.

00:39:58.079 --> 00:40:00.760
Listen to your Mom and Dad.

00:40:01.920 --> 00:40:03.960
I know my daughter.

00:40:04.039 --> 00:40:04.880
She truly sees you

00:40:04.880 --> 00:40:07.440
as her own child.

00:40:08.079 --> 00:40:08.880
I know.

00:40:10.360 --> 00:40:11.400
My mom is

00:40:11.400 --> 00:40:12.360
the toughest mom in the world.

00:40:12.960 --> 00:40:14.599
But she's never been harsh with me.

00:40:16.440 --> 00:40:17.199
Do you remember

00:40:17.199 --> 00:40:19.440
when you first met me?

00:40:21.039 --> 00:40:22.320
You were afraid of me.

00:40:24.039 --> 00:40:25.800
I did that on purpose.

00:40:25.960 --> 00:40:27.400
I wanted you to fear me.

00:40:27.480 --> 00:40:28.199
I know.

00:40:28.360 --> 00:40:30.480
I acted like I didn't like you.

00:40:30.639 --> 00:40:31.440
Because

00:40:31.599 --> 00:40:33.519
deep down, I felt

00:40:33.800 --> 00:40:35.519
my daughter had suffered too much.

00:40:35.599 --> 00:40:36.599
You didn't know,

00:40:36.880 --> 00:40:38.119
but I loved you.

00:40:38.280 --> 00:40:39.639
- I see you as my real granddaughter.
- I know.

00:40:39.719 --> 00:40:41.039
Grandma, I know everything.

00:40:42.159 --> 00:40:43.480
Such a good girl.

00:40:44.719 --> 00:40:46.199
Don't cry, Wenwen.

00:40:47.119 --> 00:40:48.960
I'm dizzy. Really dizzy.

00:40:49.599 --> 00:40:50.920
Let me lie down for a bit...

00:40:51.400 --> 00:40:52.159
Grandma.

00:40:52.440 --> 00:40:53.400
I'm scared.

00:40:53.599 --> 00:40:54.360
Talk to me.

00:40:54.360 --> 00:40:55.440
Then I won't be afraid.

00:40:55.760 --> 00:40:57.599
I'm here. Don't be scared.

00:41:02.480 --> 00:41:04.079
You are just like Tong.

00:41:05.000 --> 00:41:06.760
You both love my stories.

00:41:12.280 --> 00:41:14.000
Tong has had it hard.

00:41:15.639 --> 00:41:17.800
Life has been cruel to her.

00:41:42.360 --> 00:41:43.079
Wenwen!

00:41:43.119 --> 00:41:43.639
Wenwen!

00:41:46.119 --> 00:41:46.760
Wenwen!

00:41:46.840 --> 00:41:47.679
Wenwen!

00:41:49.760 --> 00:41:50.360
Wenwen!

00:41:50.400 --> 00:41:51.000
Wenwen!

00:41:51.039 --> 00:41:51.719
Wenwen!

00:41:55.199 --> 00:41:56.320
Tiezhu. Start it!

00:41:59.480 --> 00:42:00.000
Try again.

00:42:02.199 --> 00:42:02.880
Keep going.

00:42:02.880 --> 00:42:04.400
The key is about to snap.

00:42:05.239 --> 00:42:06.800
Where did you buy this junk?

00:42:07.960 --> 00:42:08.639
Unbelievable.

00:42:10.800 --> 00:42:12.039
Tiezhu, it's Mr. Yu.

00:42:12.320 --> 00:42:13.119
Answer it.

00:42:13.559 --> 00:42:14.559
Hello, Mr. Yu?

00:42:14.719 --> 00:42:16.360
I'm where you told me to go,

00:42:16.360 --> 00:42:17.119
but no one is here.

00:42:17.119 --> 00:42:18.119
Do you have a more exact location?

00:42:18.119 --> 00:42:19.079
Where are they?

00:42:20.288 --> 00:42:23.555
(Outpatient)

00:42:26.440 --> 00:42:28.400
Grandma, I can't get home.

00:42:29.039 --> 00:42:30.400
Grandma, where are you?

00:42:31.280 --> 00:42:33.119
Grandma, I can't find my way home.

00:42:33.480 --> 00:42:34.320
Grandma.

00:42:54.880 --> 00:42:55.519
What happened?

00:42:56.239 --> 00:42:56.719
What's wrong?

00:42:56.840 --> 00:42:57.679
I will get a doctor.

00:42:57.840 --> 00:42:58.400
Stay calm.

00:42:58.599 --> 00:42:59.280
Doctor!

00:42:59.519 --> 00:43:00.159
Doctor!

00:43:05.080 --> 00:43:07.880
(Next Episode)

00:43:08.199 --> 00:43:09.400
(Actor, Guo Jingfei)
Hi, I'm Guo Jingfei.

00:43:09.480 --> 00:43:11.880
(Actor, Guo Jingfei)
I invite you to watch Wonder Wall.

00:43:12.199 --> 00:43:12.880
My mom and Wenwen

00:43:12.960 --> 00:43:13.599
have been kidnapped.

00:43:13.679 --> 00:43:14.760
Please, help us find them.

00:43:14.800 --> 00:43:15.760
The four of us

00:43:15.760 --> 00:43:16.639
have been searching all afternoon.

00:43:16.760 --> 00:43:17.639
About the 60 million,

00:43:17.760 --> 00:43:19.199
we still haven't told the police.

00:43:19.360 --> 00:43:21.000
You decide for yourselves
whether we tell them.

00:43:21.360 --> 00:43:22.239
Where the vehicle disappeared...

00:43:22.280 --> 00:43:22.760
Where did it go?

00:43:22.920 --> 00:43:24.039
For a thorough sweep.

00:43:24.400 --> 00:43:24.800
Yes.

00:43:24.920 --> 00:43:25.960
How did you get targeted?

00:43:26.119 --> 00:43:27.199
When did they start targeting you?

00:43:27.679 --> 00:43:28.119
Hello?

00:43:28.400 --> 00:43:29.360
In half an hour,

00:43:29.559 --> 00:43:30.920
get to Chenchunmen Interchange.

00:43:31.079 --> 00:43:31.920
The kidnapper called.

00:43:32.119 --> 00:43:32.760
Trace it now.

00:43:33.119 --> 00:43:34.679
The kidnapper sent me Wenwen's location.

00:43:34.840 --> 00:43:35.400
I'm forwarding it to you.

